type: software
title: "Oxygen shape optimization: a constrained Robin-diffusion benchmark"
authors:
  - family-names: "ES-SAADI"
    given-names: "Nabil"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nabil-stem/oxygen-shape-optimization"
url: "https://github.com/nabil-stem/oxygen-shape-optimization/releases/tag/v0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  An exploratory two-dimensional benchmark for maximizing steady diffusive
  transfer through Robin walls under fixed-source and geometric constraints.
  Includes finite-volume reference software, independent FEM checks, constrained
  search controls, source-wall sensitivity, executed sources and raw evidence.
  Original data and figures have separate CC-BY-4.0 terms. No globally optimal
  shape, natural-acinar optimality or general learning advantage is claimed.
